    "project_purpose": "Switcheo Finance is a decentralized exchange protocol on Ethereum that facilitates token swaps and trading through exchange and broker-style settlement contracts. External ERC-20 token contracts traded or referenced by the exchange should not be described as Switcheo-owned protocol components or included in project-owned contract counts or protocol TVL calculations.",
